+2. THE ZERO-GAME PROBE — the proxies point the wrong way
+===============================================================================
+From K4-probe-kpi-vs-win.jsonl (8 doses of r12, 4,000 games each), over the
+strength-relevant range (doses -25..30, edge -0.77 to +3.42):
+
+  Pearson r(edge, askAcc)  = -0.741
+  Pearson r(edge, declAcc) = -0.825
+
+Over all 8 doses r(edge, askAcc) flips to +0.621, but that is a single leverage
+point: at dose 40 the policy collapses and everything falls together.  The proxy
+only agrees with strength once the policy is already broken.
